(6064343, 892491, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat macro but way too grainy, sorry. I could overlook the grain if the photo were perfect in other aspects but it''s not. The light appears too harsh and the face of the dragonfly is not quite in focus. Sometimes it''s better to back off a bit and not get so close.....you''d still have a very cool photo but the imperfections wouldn''t be so noticeable and you''d be able to focus better.</td>', 'Neat macro but way too grainy, sorry. I could overlook the grain if the photo were perfect in other aspects but it''s not. The light appears too harsh and the face of the dragonfly is not quite in focus. Sometimes it''s better to back off a bit and not get so close.....you''d still have a very cool photo but the imperfections wouldn''t be so noticeable and you''d be able to focus better.', '2010-06-21 09:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
