(6065367, 892386, 117831, '<td valign="top">i like the concept i might of gone with a different background.</td>', 'i like the concept i might of gone with a different background.', '2010-06-21 23:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065368, 892382, 117831, '<td valign="top">omg his face is evil!!! LOL</td>', 'omg his face is evil!!! LOL', '2010-06-21 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065369, 892025, 117831, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2010-06-21 23:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065370, 892696, 117831, '<td valign="top">i like this image. i wish the flower would of been more crisp.</td>', 'i like this image. i wish the flower would of been more crisp.', '2010-06-21 23:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065372, 892479, 114225, '<td valign="top">How did you get the wine glass out there without making footprints ?!?</td>', 'How did you get the wine glass out there without making footprints ?!?', '2010-06-21 23:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065375, 892373, 110023, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple composition. Well done!</td>', 'Clean and simple composition. Well done!', '2010-06-21 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065376, 892332, 110023, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject you have there :) Cute!</td>', 'Interesting subject you have there :) Cute!', '2010-06-21 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065380, 892479, 110023, '<td valign="top">All I can think is how did you get that wine glass out there and not make a mark in the sand? Pretty textures and contrast.</td>', 'All I can think is how did you get that wine glass out there and not make a mark in the sand? Pretty textures and contrast.', '2010-06-21 23:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065382, 892656, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''ll certainly be impressed if this was done with no form of selective desaturation. I can see the slight green, but the water seems to have no blue in it, which could be reflections of clouds (giving you the benefit of the doubt)..</td>', 'I''ll certainly be impressed if this was done with no form of selective desaturation. I can see the slight green, but the water seems to have no blue in it, which could be reflections of clouds (giving you the benefit of the doubt)..', '2010-06-21 23:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065384, 892668, 110023, '<td valign="top">I like these colors.</td>', 'I like these colors.', '2010-06-21 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065385, 892702, 110023, '<td valign="top">You must have a good groomer to keep the poodle that white. Sweet!</td>', 'You must have a good groomer to keep the poodle that white. Sweet!', '2010-06-21 23:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065387, 892591, 110023, '<td valign="top">That eye just glows! Beautiful!</td>', 'That eye just glows! Beautiful!', '2010-06-21 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065400, 892177, 117831, '<td valign="top">this is almost sad! like a sad lil flower... ok i had to correct that comment...... then i meant to say that the yellow has a bluish halo on it</td>', 'this is almost sad! like a sad lil flower... ok i had to correct that comment...... then i meant to say that the yellow has a bluish halo on it', '2010-06-22 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065432, 892528, 117831, '<td valign="top">I cant make out what this is. and the limbs? are distracting</td>', 'I cant make out what this is. and the limbs? are distracting', '2010-06-22 01:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065433, 892278, 117831, '<td valign="top">to me there is no "point of color"</td>', 'to me there is no "point of color"', '2010-06-22 01:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065583, 892178, 75618, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this countless times but I love the composition/framing of this. The (bindi?) accentuates the eyes. One of the best in the challenge. 8</td>', 'I''ve seen this countless times but I love the composition/framing of this. The (bindi?) accentuates the eyes. One of the best in the challenge. 8', '2010-06-22 06:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065584, 892569, 75618, '<td valign="top">The bokeh and soft focus are just beautiful in this one. Not a fan of the white border. 7</td>', 'The bokeh and soft focus are just beautiful in this one. Not a fan of the white border. 7', '2010-06-22 06:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065585, 892425, 75618, '<td valign="top">Water''s a little noisy but this image exudes a wonderful sense of tranquility. 7</td>', 'Water''s a little noisy but this image exudes a wonderful sense of tranquility. 7', '2010-06-22 06:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065587, 892185, 75618, '<td valign="top">Sick of flowers but I can''t penalize you for that because this is executed well. Very polished image, the petal is integrated well. The best flower shot in this challenge. 8</td>', 'Sick of flowers but I can''t penalize you for that because this is executed well. Very polished image, the petal is integrated well. The best flower shot in this challenge. 8', '2010-06-22 06:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065588, 892588, 75618, '<td valign="top">I can''t really explain why but I like it. Very interesting. 7</td>', 'I can''t really explain why but I like it. Very interesting. 7', '2010-06-22 06:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065589, 892693, 75618, '<td valign="top">Love the bold colors and the shallow DOF make the spider really pop. 7</td>', 'Love the bold colors and the shallow DOF make the spider really pop. 7', '2010-06-22 06:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065591, 892649, 75618, '<td valign="top">Image/concept has potential but the lighting is really harsh. Was probably taken when the sun is really high in the sky. 6</td>', 'Image/concept has potential but the lighting is really harsh. Was probably taken when the sun is really high in the sky. 6', '2010-06-22 06:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065592, 891887, 75618, '<td valign="top">Great lines/composition. I think she would have stood out a little more with a tiny bit more dodging. 7</td>', 'Great lines/composition. I think she would have stood out a little more with a tiny bit more dodging. 7', '2010-06-22 06:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065594, 892716, 75618, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal! Tiny nitpicks are the shadows on her arm and some noise in the water. 8</td>', 'Very ethereal! Tiny nitpicks are the shadows on her arm and some noise in the water. 8', '2010-06-22 06:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065595, 892416, 75618, '<td valign="top">the mist/fog does wonders for this photo. 8</td>', 'the mist/fog does wonders for this photo. 8', '2010-06-22 06:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065597, 892528, 75618, '<td valign="top">This is oddly appealing, love the foreground bokeh. 7</td>', 'This is oddly appealing, love the foreground bokeh. 7', '2010-06-22 06:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065598, 892330, 75618, '<td valign="top">Great eye. Mundane scene, extraordinary photograph. 8</td>', 'Great eye. Mundane scene, extraordinary photograph. 8', '2010-06-22 06:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065669, 892274, 10785, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this as it has several good qualities... Excellent sharpness, great lighting, excellent exposure, good composition, wonderful texture and beautiful color. It also has great layers of differing elements: Layered Depth of Field from ultra sharp in the foreground to OOF in the background, layered lighting bright to dark, and layered color. It really pops! Excellent Job! I don''t know if you missed anything with this photo.</td>', 'I really enjoy this as it has several good qualities... Excellent sharpness, great lighting, excellent exposure, good composition, wonderful texture and beautiful color. It also has great layers of differing elements: Layered Depth of Field from ultra sharp in the foreground to OOF in the background, layered lighting bright to dark, and layered color. It really pops! Excellent Job! I don''t know if you missed anything with this photo.', '2010-06-22 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065670, 892319, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lengthy title detracts. Leave something to the imagination. The first phrase was good enough. Overall red tone to the image doesn''t really help the red lipstick to pop, though it does stand out. Good concept.</td>', 'Lengthy title detracts. Leave something to the imagination. The first phrase was good enough. Overall red tone to the image doesn''t really help the red lipstick to pop, though it does stand out. Good concept.', '2010-06-22 09:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065671, 892664, 10785, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really in line with the challenge details or the challenge title. There is no real point of color here. No spot of color that pops due to a neutral background or due to a contrasting color.</td>', 'This isn''t really in line with the challenge details or the challenge title. There is no real point of color here. No spot of color that pops due to a neutral background or due to a contrasting color.', '2010-06-22 09:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065672, 892524, 10785, '<td valign="top">The busy background detracts from the main subject. The shapes are too similar to the flower. You did get a pop of color but my eye travels away from the color to the right side of the image.</td>', 'The busy background detracts from the main subject. The shapes are too similar to the flower. You did get a pop of color but my eye travels away from the color to the right side of the image.', '2010-06-22 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065684, 892660, 10785, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a shot of hamburgers. I mean it''s not very interesting or anything, but the photo is quality. It is clear, in focus with a good exposure. You got some of the flame to show through the grill. It would be a great shot for advertising or some other such need.</td>', 'Not bad for a shot of hamburgers. I mean it''s not very interesting or anything, but the photo is quality. It is clear, in focus with a good exposure. You got some of the flame to show through the grill. It would be a great shot for advertising or some other such need.', '2010-06-22 10:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065697, 892547, 10785, '<td valign="top">The processing is way overdone for my tastes. Way too much saturation, way too much sharpening. Otherwise you did a good job with the complementary colors and the pop of color off the background. Sticking that flower more in the corner might help with the composition getting it more in the third.</td>', 'The processing is way overdone for my tastes. Way too much saturation, way too much sharpening. Otherwise you did a good job with the complementary colors and the pop of color off the background. Sticking that flower more in the corner might help with the composition getting it more in the third.', '2010-06-22 10:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065699, 892656, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am sensing a selective desaturation here.</td>', 'I am sensing a selective desaturation here.', '2010-06-22 10:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065710, 892716, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection of her dress in the water.</td>', 'I really like the reflection of her dress in the water.', '2010-06-22 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065712, 892695, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'Colors are gorgeous.', '2010-06-22 10:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065714, 892666, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the smooth reflections but they overpower your subject.</td>', 'I really like the smooth reflections but they overpower your subject.', '2010-06-22 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065731, 892386, 5822, '<td valign="top">Her hairdo and look is great and I like the color contrast (brown with pastel blue). Seems to have a bit of redeye though.</td>', 'Her hairdo and look is great and I like the color contrast (brown with pastel blue). Seems to have a bit of redeye though.', '2010-06-22 11:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065742, 892353, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the coppers and reds and how they contrast with the background tones. <br/>Subject is great but the lighting seems too harsh and subject too centrally located.</td>', 'I like the coppers and reds and how they contrast with the background tones. Subject is great but the lighting seems too harsh and subject too centrally located.', '2010-06-22 11:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065745, 892562, 5822, '<td valign="top">Exquisite pastels and wonderful background blur. Great focus.</td>', 'Exquisite pastels and wonderful background blur. Great focus.', '2010-06-22 11:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065913, 892046, 76712, '<td valign="top">i like the use of minimalism here :)</td>', 'i like the use of minimalism here :)', '2010-06-22 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065916, 892418, 76712, '<td valign="top">i know this will be underrated imo, but i love it, very nice abstract!</td>', 'i know this will be underrated imo, but i love it, very nice abstract!', '2010-06-22 14:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6065919, 892666, 76712, '<td valign="top">:O i really like this, very simplistic, tells a story, and meets the challenge great, all the rainy dull colors and cars, then this woman! brilliant, good luck.</td>', ':O i really like this, very simplistic, tells a story, and meets the challenge great, all the rainy dull colors and cars, then this woman! brilliant, good luck.', '2010-06-22 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
