(6066108, 892474, 61012, '<td valign="top">Challenge Relevance:6  Impact/Emotion/Mood:5.5  Technicals:4  Processing:5.5  Creativity:5.5<br/>Lighting is just a little to harsh for me and the image seems a little soft</td>', 'Challenge Relevance:6  Impact/Emotion/Mood:5.5  Technicals:4  Processing:5.5  Creativity:5.5Lighting is just a little to harsh for me and the image seems a little soft', '2010-06-22 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6066120, 892664, 68947, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly done!  I''m assuming this is a reflection/refraction shot either projected or captured through glass vs illegal.  However you did this (I hope you''ll share post challenge in your photographer''s notes because it is BRILLIANT to have done this legally and I''m now extremely curious as to just HOW you did do this...will drive me crazy now LOL!!!!), it carries a deep message and is quite fascinating, not to mention a piece of art!!!  Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'Brilliantly done!  I''m assuming this is a reflection/refraction shot either projected or captured through glass vs illegal.  However you did this (I hope you''ll share post challenge in your photographer''s notes because it is BRILLIANT to have done this legally and I''m now extremely curious as to just HOW you did do this...will drive me crazy now LOL!!!!), it carries a deep message and is quite fascinating, not to mention a piece of art!!!  Absolutely stunning!', '2010-06-22 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6066127, 892493, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very artsy style shot and reminds me of an old poster style shot.  The rules were no "Selective desat" so, it looks as though you are well within the rules! :)  From the black in the front look, I have to ask....was your model body painted white?!  Now, I have to know! LOL  I hope that you''ll share in your photographer''s notes after challenge as I''d now like to know. :)  Congrats!  Wonderful shot! :)</td>', 'Very artsy style shot and reminds me of an old poster style shot.  The rules were no "Selective desat" so, it looks as though you are well within the rules! :)  From the black in the front look, I have to ask....was your model body painted white?!  Now, I have to know! LOL  I hope that you''ll share in your photographer''s notes after challenge as I''d now like to know. :)  Congrats!  Wonderful shot! :)', '2010-06-22 17:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6066131, 892571, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL....that looks like my fridge just before I went shopping! ;)  At least it gave you reason to clean out the fridge! :)  I may have to think of a shot to do with my stove so that I have reason to clean it! LOL  This one, though simple in composition/subject matter works well for this challenge.</td>', 'LOL....that looks like my fridge just before I went shopping! ;)  At least it gave you reason to clean out the fridge! :)  I may have to think of a shot to do with my stove so that I have reason to clean it! LOL  This one, though simple in composition/subject matter works well for this challenge.', '2010-06-22 17:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6066160, 892319, 118045, '<td valign="top">What a magic picture ;°D and a great "souvenir"</td>', 'What a magic picture ;°D and a great "souvenir"', '2010-06-22 18:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
