(6067083, 892695, 75713, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 9 ... pretty sure I know the photographer because of the style and by that I mean, technically perfect, use of complimentary colors and a strong composition.  Excellent.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 9 ... pretty sure I know the photographer because of the style and by that I mean, technically perfect, use of complimentary colors and a strong composition.  Excellent.', '2010-06-23 02:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067088, 892681, 75713, '<td valign="top">Grin, so am I... sick of strawberries ... especially freezer jam..whatever happened to people who knew how to make good old fashioned jam?<br/>However, I digress.<br/>This is a technically perfect shot.. crisp focus, wonderful black b/g to make it pop and the red of the berry just begs me to change my mind and go back to eating strawberries. An 8 from me.</td>', 'Grin, so am I... sick of strawberries ... especially freezer jam..whatever happened to people who knew how to make good old fashioned jam?However, I digress.This is a technically perfect shot.. crisp focus, wonderful black b/g to make it pop and the red of the berry just begs me to change my mind and go back to eating strawberries. An 8 from me.', '2010-06-23 02:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067095, 892228, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo fascinated me.  How to get a b/g that is devoid of color except for the people. Beyond my abilities for sure. The saffron gold color of the Monks dress makes him the focal point in this shot and it fits the challenge perfectly. Photographer Nemaste. 9</td>', 'This photo fascinated me.  How to get a b/g that is devoid of color except for the people. Beyond my abilities for sure. The saffron gold color of the Monks dress makes him the focal point in this shot and it fits the challenge perfectly. Photographer Nemaste. 9', '2010-06-23 02:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067100, 892479, 75713, '<td valign="top">There is so much to see in such a simple photo.  Living at the beach I am always excited when I come across sand that has no sign of the human presence and this photo exemplifies why that is. <br/>Beautifully executed - my eyes thank you. 8</td>', 'There is so much to see in such a simple photo.  Living at the beach I am always excited when I come across sand that has no sign of the human presence and this photo exemplifies why that is. Beautifully executed - my eyes thank you. 8', '2010-06-23 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067113, 892491, 75713, '<td valign="top">There are some flaws that are evident in this photo but I cannot take a decent macro shot for the life of me so I gave it an 8 based on the detail of the creatures eyes.</td>', 'There are some flaws that are evident in this photo but I cannot take a decent macro shot for the life of me so I gave it an 8 based on the detail of the creatures eyes.', '2010-06-23 03:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067121, 892310, 75713, '<td valign="top">Variations of this photo have been done many times but you did it well.  The flower is not growing out of a sidewalk - it may or may-not have been placed in the crevice of the wall but I want to believe that it is growing there... defying all odds and thriving in spite of it''s inadequate food source, the rich soil a rose demands.  You sold me..I am giving it an 8</td>', 'Variations of this photo have been done many times but you did it well.  The flower is not growing out of a sidewalk - it may or may-not have been placed in the crevice of the wall but I want to believe that it is growing there... defying all odds and thriving in spite of it''s inadequate food source, the rich soil a rose demands.  You sold me..I am giving it an 8', '2010-06-23 03:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067127, 892480, 75713, '<td valign="top">simple composition, crisp focus on the main subject and a simplicity that makes me linger, to look, to feel quiet in my soul. 8</td>', 'simple composition, crisp focus on the main subject and a simplicity that makes me linger, to look, to feel quiet in my soul. 8', '2010-06-23 03:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6067134, 892185, 75713, '<td valign="top">Even without the different colored petal, this photo is rare. Such crispness on every plane of the flower.. such beautiful rich whites that hold detail and still glow and then the finishing touch, a stalk for it to continue it''s life cycle. Brilliant. 8</td>', 'Even without the different colored petal, this photo is rare. Such crispness on every plane of the flower.. such beautiful rich whites that hold detail and still glow and then the finishing touch, a stalk for it to continue it''s life cycle. Brilliant. 8', '2010-06-23 03:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
