(6068540, 892702, 75713, '<td valign="top">you must be sick of reading how adorable this shot is. (grin) The sweet dog, the comical hydrant .. reading the dogs mind..."you expect me to do what to this toy" .... but I reiterate all that to you.. it is adorable and well photographed. 8</td>', 'you must be sick of reading how adorable this shot is. (grin) The sweet dog, the comical hydrant .. reading the dogs mind..."you expect me to do what to this toy" .... but I reiterate all that to you.. it is adorable and well photographed. 8', '2010-06-24 01:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
