(6071609, 892247, 15511, '<td valign="top">Good street candid. It''s a very interesting image in that there''s a lot to look at - the actors, the responses of the bystanders... Items of constructive comment: I think it should be sharper; I think it should be displayed in sRGB, as the majority of browsers in use do not recognize embedded profiles, as mine did not. The conversion to sRGB helped your image in my view(er).</td>', 'Good street candid. It''s a very interesting image in that there''s a lot to look at - the actors, the responses of the bystanders... Items of constructive comment: I think it should be sharper; I think it should be displayed in sRGB, as the majority of browsers in use do not recognize embedded profiles, as mine did not. The conversion to sRGB helped your image in my view(er).', '2010-06-28 00:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
