(6072335, 892588, 17507, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 for technical merit and for its standing out as, e.g., not another picture of a flower or bug. But to me it lacked much depth or contrast; the crack and splotch could be interesting elements but weren''t really present enough to add much. Reading your comments now, this photo does somewhat come across as a "pretty much all I could think of" kind of image. Cheers, I still love ya.</td>', 'I gave you a 6 for technical merit and for its standing out as, e.g., not another picture of a flower or bug. But to me it lacked much depth or contrast; the crack and splotch could be interesting elements but weren''t really present enough to add much. Reading your comments now, this photo does somewhat come across as a "pretty much all I could think of" kind of image. Cheers, I still love ya.', '2010-06-28 17:14:53.000000', NULL, 0),
