(6072957, 892416, 73142, '<td valign="top">No selective desaturation here. It was incredibly foggy. Was like that for the four days I was there. This was taken in Aialik Bay which gets about three times more precipitation than Seward, AK. Thanks for your vote Penny. <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> this looks like desat to me but maybe just fog? I like the simplicity.<br/> <br/>edited - I voted! (originally said I wouldn''t). </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'No selective desaturation here. It was incredibly foggy. Was like that for the four days I was there. This was taken in Aialik Bay which gets about three times more precipitation than Seward, AK. Thanks for your vote Penny. Originally posted by PennyStreet: this looks like desat to me but maybe just fog? I like the simplicity. edited - I voted! (originally said I wouldn''t). ', '2010-06-29 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
